"Poetry is good\nReaders are crap\nThey won't understand \nAnd just can't wrap\n\nAvoid sending poems to them\nThey'll mock or pass by\nSend it to those who read\nAnd understand deeply without a lie\n\nDiamonds are precious\nA common fellow will wear\nThose who know it's true worth\nWill forge something without fear"